1
00:00:00,638 --> 00:00:02,908
(Amy:)Okay, I'm starting
to feel guilty.

2
00:00:02,907 --> 00:00:05,137
(Amy:)Aren't we being a little mean?

3
00:00:06,477 --> 00:00:08,377
(Raj:)That's a fair point.

4
00:00:08,379 --> 00:00:11,149
(Raj:)We wouldn't make fun of someone
like this to their face.

5
00:00:11,983 --> 00:00:14,353
Look, it's Stuart!

6
00:00:16,821 --> 00:00:19,591
(Raj:)You may want
to leave the room.

7
00:00:23,628 --> 00:00:26,828
SHELDON:
Right this way, Uncle Harvey.

8
00:00:31,569 --> 00:00:33,569
(Leonard:)Will you stop with that already?

9
00:00:33,571 --> 00:00:36,871
(Howard:)I'm trying
not to attract attention.

10
00:00:36,874 --> 00:00:39,944
(Leonard:)And tipping his hat to the
cleaning lady didn't do that?

11
00:00:39,944 --> 00:00:43,514
She said, “Buenas noches.”
What was he supposed to do?

12
00:00:43,514 --> 00:00:45,484
(Leonard:)Let's just start
the experiment.

13
00:00:45,483 --> 00:00:47,413
(Sheldon:)Leonard, we should probably
have our story straight

14
00:00:47,418 --> 00:00:48,788
(Sheldon:)in case we get caught.

15
00:00:48,786 --> 00:00:50,556
(Leonard:)We're not getting caught.

16
00:00:50,555 --> 00:00:51,655
(Sheldon:)Well, you can't be sure of that.

17
00:00:51,656 --> 00:00:53,686
(Sheldon:)What if the helium dealer
rats us out?

18
00:00:53,691 --> 00:00:55,821
(Sheldon:)What if Kripke asks
where we got it?

19
00:00:55,827 --> 00:00:57,727
(Sheldon:)What if the university
checks my family tree

